  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Imposing Mausoleum</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Casting class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use an effect for which two or more wild magic events are guaranteed and a major event is possible, you may negate one non-major event before it is rolled to increase the chance of a major wild magic event by 50%. If you possess at least 4 wild magic feats, you may negate up to two non-major events to increase the chance of a major wild magic event by 100%. These increases to major wild magic chance can result in multiple major wild magic events in the same manner that multiple normal wild magic events can occur.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/wild-magic-feats#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
